  "contentHtml": "\n                      <div><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;.SF UI Text&quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69); min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;.SFUIText&quot;; font-size: 15pt;\"></span><br></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">こんにちは</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">小坂菜緒です</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">この間のBリーグ特番見てくれました？？？</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">私はアリーナグルメを新開発しに、久美さんと秋田に行ってきました✨</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">秋田では「秋田ノーザンハピネッツ」の谷口選手・保岡選手と一緒にアリーナグルメの手がかりとなる情報を探しに行ったり、実際に試食していただいたり！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">本当にありがとうございました！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">私が番組で着てたユニフォームも「秋田ノーザンハピネッツ」のユニフォームでした！！！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">初めて秋田に行って、本当に優しい方ばかりで、ご飯も美味しかったし♪♪</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">また秋田に行きたいなぁって思いました💫</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">夜ご飯はスタッフさんと久美さんと稲庭うどんを食べに行きました~♪</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">稲庭うどんもきりたんぽもいぶりがっこもはたはたも、秋田の名産は全部めーっちゃ美味しくて大満足の秋田ロケでした✨</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">秋田ノーザンハピネッツの皆様、そして秋田県の皆様、本当にありがとうございました！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">*☼*―――――*☼*―――――</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">遅くなりましたが</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">Re:Mind購入者抽選イベント</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">来て下さりありがとうございました！！！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">久しぶりにスピンオフの制服着て、みんなであの頃は懐かしかったなぁ。なんて言いながら、楽しいイベントになりました♪</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2018-10-08/26416_0.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_5324.jpeg\"></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">今ではほとんど着ることのない白のセーター</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">意外とレアかもね…⸜(*˙꒳˙*)⸝</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">みんな髪型とかもその時の髪にしてたんですけど、私は髪の毛を切ったから、リアルにその時と同じ感じになりました(◦ˉ&nbsp;˘&nbsp;ˉ◦)</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">懐かしや~</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">イベントの最後には各メンバーの直筆サイン入りチェキがくじ引きでその場で当たるコーナーや、全員のサイン入りポスターが抽選で1名の方に当たるなど！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">本当に楽しかったですね✨</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">私のチェキが当たった方、大切にしてくださいね🐰💓</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">来て下さりありがとうございました！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2018-10-08/26416_1.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_5317.jpeg\"></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">また？？？？(Re:Mindの本編には出てませんが…)</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">みんなでドラマやりたいな…♪♪</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">*☼*―――――*☼*―――――</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">舞台「ザンビ」について！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">なんと、今回ダブルキャストになりました！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">乃木坂46さんからは、久保ちゃん・梅澤さん</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">漢字欅さんからは、菅井さん・守屋さん</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">ひらがなけやきからは、芽実さん・史帆さん</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 17.9px;\"><span style=\"background